    "ruleType": "unit-ability",
    "group": "Firestorm",
    "summary": "Each time the **[Fire Overwatch](vsdata:ability/core.fire-overwatch)** Stratagem targets this model right after an enemy unit able to **FLY** begins or ends an Advance, Normal or **Fall Back move**, besides shooting that unit as the Stratagem resolves, this model may:\n\n- Pick up to 3 more enemy units that can **FLY** and are 24\" or less from it.\n- Shoot each of them that is an eligible target with its Firestorm scatter laser.\n- Hit those extra units only on unmodified **Hit rolls** of 6.",
